      "classification": "incorrectly-named-placeholder",
      "primaryChinese": [
        {
          "unitId": "s0193",
          "zh": "平原劉孝標爲著論曰：",
          "literal": "Liu Xiaobiao of Pingyuan wrote a discourse, saying:",
          "idiomatic": "Liu Xiaobiao of Pingyuan wrote a discourse, saying:"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "s0229",
          "zh": "陸大夫燕喜西都，郭有道人倫東國，公卿貴其籍甚，搢紳羨其登仙。",
          "literal": "Grand Master Lu feasted in the western capital; Guo the Worthy ranked men in the eastern state; dukes and ministers prized his great fame, gentry envied his ascent to immortals.",
          "idiomatic": "Grand Master Lu feasted in the western capital; Guo the Worthy ranked men in the eastern state; nobles prized his fame, gentry envied his ascent among immortals."
        }
      ],
      "findings": [
        "The only Chinese naming of the discourse author in this chapter is s0193 「平原劉孝標爲著論曰：」. The discourse follows without narrative interruption from s0194 (「客問主人曰」) to its closing quotation mark in s0278; s0279 resumes Ren Fang's biography (「昉撰《雜傳》…」).",
        "liangshu:014:p058 (Liu Xiaobiao 劉孝標) already owns that explicit name with a surface span at s0193 [0], an attestation (AD 508) and authorship claims at s0193. The same independent review approved p058 under per_853W30JZBZ2MEVRJ14VR (case sha256:0d8c502edcf02c654b5882324f7c750f46b4929bca9128e534f109ed0c2a94bc) with witness 劉孝標 at s0193.",
        "p079 was created by extraction chunk 002 (run-a02c91bf-0a3b-48cb-ad07-7112a8236801), whose owned units begin inside the discourse; its own note says the author is \"named only in the prior chapter chunk\". It is the same chapter speaker as p058, split at a chunk boundary, not a second person.",
        "s0229 contains only 陸大夫 (Lu Jia allusion, owned by p080) and 郭有道; it names neither 劉峻 nor 孝標. p079 has no surface rows anywhere.",
        "劉峻 does not occur anywhere in liangshu/014 Chinese (zero units contain 峻), and the title 廣絕交論 does not occur either (the only 絕交 hits are s0194 and s0206, both about Zhu Mu's 《絕交論》). Both are outside knowledge, not chapter evidence, so neither may be carried forward.",
        "The quotable descriptive witness for this speaker is therefore s0193 「平原劉孝標」, which already belongs to p058. Re-pointing p079's name evidence to s0193 would duplicate p058's mention span. The exact correction is to retire p079 and move its quoted-speaker and discourse-attribution edges to p058."
      ],
